WEBVTT

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.230
What just happened?

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.490
This spiritual power...

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.890
Aren't you forgetting 
something, Lord Shinryuu?

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.300
Tanmoku Ki isn't the only 
member of the Tanmoku family.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.960
What happened to Iku?

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.270
Don't worry. She's safe.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.970
However, she's in shock due 
to Shouken's soul scattering.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.430
His soul?

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.270
I have a message from Shouken.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:46.100
"I don't want you to try and bring 
someone back from the dead."

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.650
"I did everything of my own accord.
It has nothing to do with anyone else."

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.900
"Treasure those around you now."

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.630
Shouken...

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:08.380
Shouken, you were naive to the very end!

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:16.630
Evil spirits?!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.030
Get them!

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:29.690
Final Episode
The Bonds That Bind Me

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:05.720
Shinryuu Sekijin, Shouken made his wish.

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.730
He wants you to live your own life.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:17.240
You Keika, it doesn't matter what 
you say. Protect your master!

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.200
Jiun!

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.210
Call me "my lady"!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.230
Damn it. I just can't win.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.870
Tanmoku Ki?

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.570
I told you. Don't hurt my spirit shadow!

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.590
The Qian Lunar Mirror is absorbing 
your spiritual powers.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.360
If you keep wasting them, you're 
going to deal with the backlash.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.700
I'll just have to break it, then!

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.610
Fool, know your place.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.140
<i>Keika, find the talisman 
he's using for the hypnosis spell.</i>

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.620
<i>What?</i>

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:52.620
<i>He would need a talisman to maintain 
a hypnosis spell this strong.</i>

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:58.850
<i>Find it and destroy it.</i>

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.130
<i>Where would it be, though?</i>

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.800
<i>The spell should be marked on the 
skin of the person casting it.</i>

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.150
<i>Could it be that mark?</i>

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:25.110
Hey, redhead, wake up! You care 
about Tanmoku Ki, don't you?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.740
Didn't he steal Tanmoku Ki from you?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.790
Are you okay?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.710
Leave him to me. You deal with Sekijin!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.790
Thanks.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.740
You have others do your
 dirty work because you're weak.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:07.220
Why are you so desperate? 
He's never cared about you!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.700
You can't get to me!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:14.100
Even if that were the case, 
I'm protecting him of my own free will.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.830
Got a problem with that?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.110
That reminds me.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:47.950
Hey, Tanmoku Ki, make a pact 
connection with me. A real one.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:51.000
I can't. You don't know what you're talking—

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.950
Shut up. Just keep quiet and listen to me.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.830
<i>Impossible, the Qian Lunar Mirror is...</i>

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:50.230
Their combined power overcame 
the Qian Lunar Mirror.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:56.870
A true pact connection is a vow 
to share each other's fate.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.540
Any damage to the body is dispersed,

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:05.480
and the power they both 
possess grows exponentially.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.210
Perhaps this is fate.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:13.030
All the events that have transpired

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.950
over the past thousand years
 have led to this moment.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.780
He may also be the key 
to breaking through this.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.960
Master, that's the soul-binding 
circle book, right?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.570
Kyuu, we're going to the 
Tanmoku residence now.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:28.960
Okay.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.480
Shinryuu Sekijin, you have 
no chance of winning.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.210
My lord!

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.480
Iku Sashi.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.490
I'm sorry. I failed 
to protect Shouken's soul.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.860
What of his remains?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.100
They are being taken to the 
Shinryuu residence, but...

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:57.000
That's fine. I'll kill the Youmeishi!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.580
It's all a trap! Please stop.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:05.260
There are talismans all over this 
mountain. We are being watched.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:06.140
What?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:09.960
It's about time. Everyone is here.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.310
Everyone? Who do you mean?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.170
When did they get here?

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.980
Shinryuu Sekijin, I know 
about all your misdeeds.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.330
Give yourself up willingly.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:30.170
Mistress, there are people here 
with competent spiritual abilities.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.500
Do you intend to dig your own grave?

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.740
You are the ones who don't 
understand the situation.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.450
Perhaps you're right.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.960
We may not know what has been happening 
behind the scenes of the Tanmoku family,

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:48.170
but why don't we take this opportunity 
to grasp the situation from others?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:53.480
Tanmoku Ki used the soul-binding spell

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.970
to restrain Shinryuu Shouken for two years.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.800
Th-The soul-binding spell?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:08:59.970
It's a forbidden spell.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:05.420
That is a forbidden spell.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:09.860
It is a considerable sin for a 
Youmeishi to cast it.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.990
And while my brother was bound,

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.040
he collected his blood 
for his own selfish purposes.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.950
This is also a great sin against humanity.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.220
When I sent my brother off 
to the Tanmoku family,

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.950
I believed he would return 
home safely after a few years.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:30.460
But my brother was horribly 
deceived and died as a result.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:34.970
The Youmeishi wishes for the happiness 
of all the people in the world,

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:40.510
and yet, can you say he has fulfilled 
his duties by his actions?

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.390
He took my brother's life!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:48.400
Are you saying your actions are for the 
happiness of all the people in the world?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:52.960
Until now, the Shinryuu family has 
thought of ways to save the world

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.400
in cooperation with the Tanmoku family,

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.940
but you have only served your own ambitions.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:02.370
I know about the countless terrible 
things you've done behind the scenes.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.370
Killing the Youmeishi now goes against 
the teachings of your predecessors.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.710
Would you be able to face the 
Shinryuu family ancestors like this?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.380
Please calm yourself, mistress.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.880
This is all part of the observer's duty.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:20.720
I've never heard of the observer before.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.970
Shinryuu Sekijin, you know what it means 
to have said that word, don't you?

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.580
Please listen.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:32.910
The duty of the observer has been 
bestowed to the Shinryuu family.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:37.530
Should the Youmeishi stray from their path, 
we have the ability to execute them.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:41.970
Tanmoku Ki, who has committed a great sin,
 certainly deserves to be executed.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:44.010
The observer is a double-edged sword.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.280
There is nothing wrong so long 
as they remain impartial.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.370
However, it is possible for 
them to abuse their power

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.960
and take the life of an innocent Youmeishi.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:57.140
Countless Youmeishi have been killed 
over the years due to false accusations.

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:58.830
Grandmother.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.090
My husband and my child.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.660
Where's your proof?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:09.180
There is something wrong with you 
insulting an observer without evidence.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:13.190
You are no longer the observer.

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.440
What?

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.820
Iku Sashi, why don't you show 
your lord what she means?

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.450
What is it?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:26.540
My lord, I got this letter from Jiun-sama.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.830
It pains me to give you this.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.460
As you can see in the letter,

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:43.070
the Shinryuu family has released 
from your duties as the observer.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.090
That was sent to the Tanmoku family.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:50.560
You should receive the 
official notice as well.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.490
Let it go, my lord.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:58.070
Preposterous! There's no 
way they could do this.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:01.310
Shinryuu Sekijin, didn't you 
find it the least bit strange

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.610
that all your plans went off without a hitch?

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.160
We've known about what you've 
been plotting all along.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.430
Had you not gone so far, 
it never would have come to this.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.620
You crossed the final line.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:21.760
You asked if we have proof? Of course we do.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.410
We have been collecting evidence 
of your sins for generations

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:30.340
and we sent it all to them 
without leaving anything out.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.770
Everything up until today.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:38.620
And tonight they have seen your misdeeds 
properly with their own eyes.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.860
Do you really think they'll overlook this?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:45.640
Our Shinryuu family has 
been around for centuries.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.510
This scrap of paper means nothing.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.190
You can remove the post of the observer

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.420
but the dignity of the Shinryuu 
family will never change.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:57.580
Is that so? We have all seen what 
the Shinryuu family has done today.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.690
The fact that you would even 
lay a hand on the Youmeishi

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:03.970
means that you consider us 
all beneath you. Quite scary.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.320
As the representative of the Ouyou family,

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:09.330
I propose that the Shinryuu clan be banished.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.140
Banished?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:10.810
That's a bit excessive.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.750
The Shin family representative 
agrees with his proposal.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:17.130
I agree.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:21.480
It appears that the centuries 
of glory end here.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:26.290
Shinryuu Sekijin, you have brought 
all of this upon yourself.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:31.500
Ridiculous! All of you, stop being 
fooled by the Tanmoku family.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.790
The Shinryuu family has fulfilled it's duty

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.500
and served the world along 
with the Tanmoku family.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.820
This false accusation that 
I have only been serving my own interests

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.420
is outlandish!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.130
Shinryuu Sekijin,

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:47.050
if you really were just fulfilling your duty,
 you would not have been dismissed.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.980
First the Shito family, 
now the Shinryuu family?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:56.390
Mistress, this is quite the setup.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.900
I'm warning you, this isn't the end.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.020
One day you will regret this!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.340
This Youmeishi does nothing but harm.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:09.490
Tanmoku Ki, I will obliterate you here 
and now, even if it costs me my life!

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.160
My lord!

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:20.920
<i>His face looks just like Tanmoku Ki's!</i>

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:29.690
My lord, I'm begging you. Please stop this.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:33.650
Tanmoku Ki, I will never forgive you!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:39.270
No, you'll never be able to forgive yourself.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:46.190
<i>Shouken, I used you like you were a tool.</i>

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:50.820
<i>By the time I realized you were 
what mattered most to me...</i>

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:54.610
<i>Shouken, I made a mistake.</i>

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:01.710
<i>I would abandon everything 
if you'd come back.</i>

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.810
Go home. Bury Shouken's remains.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.870
What? You're letting him go?

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.690
I've learned all that I wanted to know.

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:20.820
Besides, it's not my place to punish him.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:24.370
Shouken, I understand how you feel.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.610
Rest assured, I've grown up.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.230
I'm not being pushed around anymore.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:36.700
And I found the person I was looking for.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:45.810
Did you hear?

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:49.150
All the members of the Shinryuu 
family disappeared overnight.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:52.570
No way! There are hundreds of 
people in the Shinryuu family.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:53.840
I'm telling you it's true.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.850
No one knows where they went. It's so weird.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.730
I'm sure the young lady is sad.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:05.360
I'm sure she is. She still cared 
for Shinryuu Shouken, so—

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.170
Hey, look.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.660
Th-That's... the young lady?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.790
If that's what you've decided, 
then I'm not going to stop you.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.160
But you don't need to rush things.

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:26.290
This is my last chance to become 
a student of that person.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.220
The Shinryuu family has collapsed,

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:32.310
and it doesn't bode well for the future 
if there is no one in the Tanmoku family

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.430
who can handle poisons.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.640
I will study as hard as I can
for the Tanmoku family.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:46.260
<i>You will encounter many hardships after 
 you leave. Take care of yourself.</i>

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.150
Have you moved on?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.630
Who knows? I'm still not sure if I have.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.530
I just can't keep living in the past.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.280
Let's go. I'll take you.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.670
Don't die before I get back.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:20.010
Jiun is as prideful as ever.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:25.020
You both quarrel so much I can't 
really tell if you get along or not.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:29.020
You came today to bring me the 
real soul-binding spell book?

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.820
Aren't you going to ask me why I gave
you a fake one the last time?

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.030
It was for my own sake.

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:39.650
That's right. It is a forbidden spell,
 and if you had used it,

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:44.040
you would pay dearly for it and 
lose your eyesight, like I did.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:47.290
Then why did you decide to give it to me?

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.140
I want to bet on what's possible.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.800
That reminds me, tell me one thing.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:57.800
Why do you act so desperately 
for your spirit shadow?

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.770
All the spirits want my power,

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:09.770
but he is the only one who shares 
his power with me when I am weak.

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:13.270
You wish for me to be better,

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.530
the Tanmoku family wishes for me
 to be an admirable Youmeishi,

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:21.700
and Shouken wished for me to get 
stronger in standing up to people.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:26.080
Shin Shiyou wishes for love from me.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:31.290
The whole world wishes for me 
to protect them from disaster.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:36.300
Even my own parents had expectations of me.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.540
But Keika...

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:43.330
Keika is the only one who 
wants nothing from me.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:51.900
He's not impressed by my perfect appearance 
and he doesn't abandon me when I'm weak.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.460
As long as I am myself,

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:03.450
even if I can't do anything or have any 
kind of status, he will never blame me.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:08.450
He values who I am as a person.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:14.500
He is the only one who is 
in my past and my future.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:24.550
Master, what kind of life will you lead?

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:29.930
A life in which I fulfill 
my duties to the utmost

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:33.500
so that I do not shame 
myself or the universe.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.850
Life is complicated.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:43.780
I couldn't express it in a single thought.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:48.910
That's a soul-binding circle?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.540
Yes, it binds a soul and 
makes living corpses.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.530
Like Shouken?

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.330
What will you use it for?

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.780
To get rid of spirits without attachments.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:06.510
We don't have that string anymore
 and the soul-binding ring has its limits.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.570
Without something to bind 
you to this earth...

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.020
Tanmoku...

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.190
...you'll become an evil spirit.

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.020
Tanmoku Ki.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:22.030
I have one. I have an attachment.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:26.030
Tanmoku Ki, you are the 
connection that binds me.

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:29.550
As long as you exist, I won't disappear.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.020
You wrote that in the spirit 
shadow contract, didn't you?

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.300
Oh yeah, I have a present 
for you. Close your eyes.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:47.260
<i>But Keika, I want you to continue 
existing even after I'm dead.</i>

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.020
Okay, it's ready. Open your eyes.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.550
Happy birthday, Tanmoku Ki.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:57.520
Congratulations, Tanmoku Ki
May you live to be 100!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:03.820
Master, it's your birthday, right?

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.920
No one else is supposed to 
know your real birthday,

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.740
so I learned how to make a cake on the sly.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.910
Don't worry. No one saw me.
I have a candle, too.

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:16.210
Here.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:19.630
Happy 18th birthday, Tanmoku Ki.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.340
Thank you.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:27.850
Try it.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.310
It's way too sweet! How much 
sugar did you put in it?

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.810
Really? I thought you liked sweet.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:40.230
There are limits to everything.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.820
Say "ahh."

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:48.820
If You Keika shows up, tell him I'm training 
and I'm not seeing any people.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.770
He's not a person.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:55.620
Spirits, youkai, dogs, cats, 
it doesn't matter! I'm not seeing them!

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:59.050
In Tetsu-sama, please calm down.

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:01.490
You were affected by that hypnosis spell.

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:05.380
You have been holding back for many years, 
so there was nothing you could do.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:07.690
Why didn't the spell work on You Keika?

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:09.340
Losing to him like this sucks.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:14.530
He doesn't want anything from the Youmeishi 
despite being his spirit shadow.

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:18.230
I guess that means I'm just a youkai.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.810
Block the passages that 
were opened in the barrier.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:25.820
Until that day comes, I won't see Tanmoku Ki.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:30.820
The barrier is all set on this end.

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:31.500
Same here.

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.830
Good. According to our lord's orders,

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:38.980
all passages out are to be blocked and 
everyone is prohibited from leaving.

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:41.220
Don't let anyone out.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:42.130
Yes, sir!

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:46.850
Hey, the lord is apparently healing 
Shouken-sama with poisonous insects.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:50.410
He's been dead for years, though.
Can he be healed?

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:52.490
It's a secret medicine passed down
through the Shinryuu family.

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:54.670
I'm sure our lord will be able to heal him.

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:00.710
But isn't it kind of overdoing it to use 
poisonous insects on his own brother?

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:03.940
The poisonous insect can 
repair cerebral nerves.

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:07.580
It's the only way that 
Shouken-sama can be healed.

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:12.700
He's the lord's only 
blood relative after all.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.390
Welcome back, Shouken.

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:25.960
Viewer Submission End Card

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:25.960
Illustrated by: Himekawa Mari

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.980
Illustrations by Chinese viewers

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.980
Thank you for watching
